                "loc": "EXO.37.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 37:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwany gigipiny manitie gi kur loyo kilo aucel ma sandi manitie gi kur mamit ma yath m'ilwoŋo ni mira, kilo adek ma gim'onuŋere manitie gi kur mamit m'ilwoŋo ni cinamon, kilo adek ma midole manitie gi kur mamit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kilo aucel ma kasia (joje pima gi rapim m'ioro). Imedi lita aŋwen ma mo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka itimi mo ma wir maleŋ, m'oruw pa mo manitie gi kur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or ma wiro Wema Maleŋ, Kakan ma Cikirok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meza gi gigipiny mere je, raŋaw tala gi gigipiny mere je, migam ma waŋo buban, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "migam ma waŋo mic, kanyacel gi gigipiny mere je, kodi kalaya gi pende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imiyan gigipiny me i nger me, aka jobino bedo maleŋ kicutho, aka nyatoro kosa gimoro m'ogey jo bino miyo litho gi meni ma leŋo pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo wir Aron gi wote, aka ikwoŋ jo paka jocway ri Were i wi migam jowotiy ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waci ri Joisiraili ni, ‘Mo maleŋ woor i tic paran i hongo ma bino je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiripi konjo kwoŋ ji ma kisi ndelo, aka ikir'ior nger acel ma ruwo mo man ma cale gine. Leŋ, aka iripo tero paka gimaleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋat'otim mo ma cale gine kosa oor kwoŋ ŋata k'obedo jacway ri Were i wi migam k'okwanere paka acel kwoŋ ji paran kendo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buban",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Kwany adec marom ma kisi gigipiny ma jonitie gi ŋwece kur me: Sitakite, onyca, galibanum, kodi buban macil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or ma timo buban, m'oruw paka mo manitie gi kur. Medi cumbi woloki macil kendo maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odi adec mere wonuŋere, ter i Wema Maleŋ, aka ikiri ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok. Ter buban me maleŋ kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'ior nger acel ma timo buban man ma cale gine riwin wegi. Ter win paka gimaleŋ m'omiyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro otim buban ma cale gine ma oro paka mo manitie gi kur, go k'okwanere paka acel kwoŋ ji paran kendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
